  - id: Cycle1
    lines:
    - Huh? Why is the indicator weird?
    - It should've been stable!
  - id: Mistake
    lines:
    - DON'T SWITCH IT ON!
    - Emergency procedures require all systems deactivated.
  - id: Opening
    lines:
    - You'll be working here from now on.
    - You can check which sector has power or not in the computer on the desk.
    - Seems like power is out on sector A.
    - Go find the panel and fix it quickly before time runs out!
